        1   using Ibs.Th.Rul.Route-data_.
        2   using ibs.th.bge.1crn.export.expsubject from propath.
        3   using ibs.th.bge.1crn.subjects.iexpsubject from propath.
        4   using ibs.th.bge.1crn.subjects.fbr-gd-doc from propath.
        5   block-level on error undo, throw.
        6   define input parameter parparentproc as widget-handle no-undo .
        7   define input parameter p-parent-handle as handle no-undo .
        8   define input parameter p-log-handle  as handle no-undo .
        9   define input parameter p-cont-handle  as handle no-undo .
